+  `VoiceImageryView.kt`（11 种动效实时渲染）、`VoiceImageryPickerDialog.kt`（快捷切换悬浮窗）
+- `app/src/main/java/com/osfans/trime/ui/main/settings/VoiceImagerySettingsFragment.kt`
+- `app/src/main/res/layout/`：`fragment_dahi_voice_imagery.xml`、`item_dahi_vi_header.xml`、`item_dahi_vi_option.xml`
+- `app/src/main/res/values/strings_dahi_voice_imagery.xml`、`strings_dahi_floating.xml`
